/-!
# M14 periodic proof-carrying common clearing

The ninth pre-emitter coordinate is installed at every generated finite visit
of the literal joint root.  Its local disposition remains the existing M4
automatic fulfillment result; its temporal occurrence, selected write,
whole-ledger evolution, responsibility consumer, and next are generated by
the root at that visit.

The local M4 settlement occurrence and the temporal root occurrence are kept
as different typed readouts.  This module never equates them.  The public
producer accepts only `depth`; clearing source, run, coverage, mandate, PCL,
row, ledger, and next authority are generated internally.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
namespace M14PeriodicCommonClearingRenewal

noncomputable section

open ResponsibilityLifecycle LivingLawEvolution ConstructiveRoot
open Lifecycle Universal Relations Exchange Settlement Renewal Revision
open Election Power
